TR-1um GDS Viewer
https://github.com/PenguinEino/tr1um_gds_viewer

This project is a modified fork of Tiny Tapeout GDS Viewer:
https://github.com/TinyTapeout/tinytapeout_gds_viewer
Original viewer by its respective contributors; original Apache License 2.0
is retained in LICENSE. This fork is maintained by PenguinEino.
Copyright 2026 PenguinEino (fork contributions).

Changes in this fork include TR-1um layer selection, labels and pins,
GDS loading and parser fixes, rendering, layer spacing, 2D/3D modes,
MPW presets, translations and community links. Modified source files
are marked; src/gds_processor.js and src/gds_processor.wasm are rebuilt
from the modified gds_processor/src/gds_processor.cpp and build files.
package.json and package-lock.json contain fork-specific package metadata.

